# Project Overview

This project is a reusable multi-tenant SaaS boilerplate.

Backend:
- NestJS
- TypeScript strict mode
- MySQL
- Prisma ORM
- JWT authentication
- RBAC and permission-based authorization

Frontend:
- Next.js App Router
- TypeScript strict mode
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui
- React Hook Form
- Zod
- TanStack Query

The platform has three user levels:
1. Super Admin: founder/platform owner
2. Tenant Owner/Admin: school or business owner
3. Tenant Users: employees, teachers, accountants, managers, etc.

Always design features as reusable SaaS modules.
Do not hardcode school-only or ERP-only logic in the core boilerplate.
Core modules should support future products like School Management, ERP, CRM, HRM, Inventory, Billing, and similar SaaS products.
